From 4a54392415d4c385fd35d2bb27c66c3c34e0bb91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sysadmin <sysadmin@localhost>
Date: Mon, 2 Feb 2026 11:50:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Integrate arbos-revm, vendor alloy-evm, add Stylus
 support

This commit includes all backend changes for arbos-foundry:

1. Remove Optimism/Celo support
   - Remove op-revm, alloy-op-evm, op-alloy-* dependencies
   - Remove Celo network support and precompiles
   - Simplify NetworkConfigs to empty struct

2. Vendor alloy-evm crate
   - Add local crates/alloy-evm with customized precompiles handling
   - Export EthEvmContext, PrecompilesMap, and other types

3. Wire arbos-revm as EVM backend
   - Use arbos-revm for state handling with ArbosStateParams
   - Add apply_arbitrum_state_overrides to Backend
   - Conditional state modifications for Merkle proof preservation
   - Use actual block/cfg env for state overrides

4. Add Stylus configuration and cheatcodes
   - Add StylusConfig for deployer_address and state params
   - Add deployStylusCode and getStylusCode cheatcodes
   - Add brotliCompress/brotliDecompress utility cheatcodes
   - Add Stylus test fixtures

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
